# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose: electron-vite writes to out/ and
# electron-builder to dist/, and an unanchored `out/` would also swallow any
# nested one. The original reason was spike/codemirror-harness/out/, which R155
# deleted after transcribing it to docs/spikes/raw-measurements.md — the
# anchoring stays because it is right regardless, not because of that directory.
/out/
/dist/
/release/
/.vite/

# Generated at build time (README, "Third-party notices").
/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test fixtures
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Written by `npm run fixtures:generate`. Around a gigabyte, deterministic, and
# regenerable — never committed. Tests that need them skip cleanly if absent.
test/fixtures/generated/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# spike/ — measurement tooling, not spikes
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Committed, not ignored, but the reason changed at R155. It used to hold spike
# apparatus whose sources were the evidence behind D-030/D-031; those documents
# now live in docs/spikes/ and the apparatus is deleted. What remains is
# re-runnable tooling — the fixture generator behind `npm run fixtures:generate`
# and the per-milestone benches several results documents cite by name.
# Spikes themselves now run on a branch and merge only their document; see
# CLAUDE.md, "Spikes".

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling and local state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.lock
.claude/worktrees/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache

# Vitest browser mode's own failure-screenshot artifacts (R10) — not the
# Electron screenshot in docs/screenshots/, which is deliberately committed.
test/__screenshots__/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local environment
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
